StructuredID ZKPP (sid-pake-core)
Copyright (C) Dmitry Prudnikov

This software implements the Zero-Knowledge Password Policy (ZKPP) method
over OPAQUE (RFC 9807) on the Pallas curve: the circuit, the verifier, a
reference prover, the private password-history relation and the key
generation they share.

